'''Bahamut Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] unlocked by completing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. True Form added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] improves his movement speed, doubles his knockback count and reduces his range + recharge time. In [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]], his True Form gained [[Multi-Hit]] with a 10% increase in attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked after beating [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked from clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. His True Form in The Battle Cats Unite! can only be unlocked once clearing [[Dead End Night]], [[Moon (Into the Future)|Raging Bahamut Cat]], and is leveled up to 20.

