==Trivia==
*Bahamut Cat is the first and only Cat Unit to have level 30 as his [[Level-up#Higher-Level Cats and Level Reduction Points|1st reduction point]].
*[[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie]] and Awakened Bahamut Cat are the first Cat Units to have [[Talents]] locked behind a stage.
*Bahamut Cat and his dragon-like appearance are a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Final Fantasy|Final Fantasy]]'' series' [[wikia:finalfantasy:Bahamut|Bahamut]] as well as the King of the Metallic Dragons in ''[[wikipedia:Dungeons & Dragons|Dungeons & Dragons]]''. Bahamut is closely associated with powerful magic called Flare, which is usually one of the most potent offensive magics available in ''DnD''. His attack in The Battle Cats may be a sort of a "Dark Flare" as well.
*Prior to [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]], Bahamut Cat had higher health and shorter recharge time. Bahamut's base health was 2,000 instead of 1,500, and had a base cooldown of 3,000 frames (100 seconds) instead of 4,800 frames (160 seconds).
*Awakened Bahamut Cat's silhouette that can only be seen when entering [[Into the Future]] Ch.3 before unlocking him has a unique idle animation. It is distinct from the units actual idle animation which is identical to his moving animation, but only the first frame of which can ever be seen naturally in game.
*Originally, Awakened Bahamut Cat only dealt 85,000 damage at level 30, [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] which gave him his multi-hit attack increased it to a total of 93,500 as it added his 2nd and 3rd attack.
*Awakened Bahamut Cat has the highest base DPS of all Cat Units without [[Talents]].
*Awakened Bahamut Cat's base DPS is higher than his HP.
*Awakened Bahamut Cat's "unmatched" speed has always been exceeded by [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|Capsule Cat]] and [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]], and later updates have only added more.
*Awakened Bahamut Cat is the first cat unit with talents to have neither an Attack or Defense buff.
*Bahamut Cat won the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PiE_4pJORI4 2025 Best Attacker Nyaward], with a speech accompanying his victory:
<blockquote>
You have done well to recognize my greatness, tiny mortals. My rivals in this category may be strong, yes. But has any other single-handedly caused an apocalypse? Nay, only Bahamut Cat! Although I may be first among attackers on this day, my comrades too are worthy of your respect! I accept this Nyaward for all attackers, and I swear that you have not yet seen the full extent of our might! Thank you, tiny mortals, and may the cats [[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic sic]] glorious campaign continue unto eternity!
</blockquote>
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Bahamut Cat's English descriptions read as follows:
